sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant API as Rescheduling API
    participant RS as ReschedulingService
    participant CSP as Constraint Checker
    participant DB as Database

    Admin->>API: POST /api/schedules/{id}/suggestions
    API->>RS: suggest_alternatives(jadwal_id)
    RS->>DB: get_available_slots()
    DB-->>RS: list of slots
    RS->>CSP: validate_slots(slots)
    CSP-->>RS: valid_slots (max 3)
    RS-->>API: JSON Rekomendasi
    API-->>Admin: Tampilkan di Dashboard
    Note over Admin: Admin mengonfirmasi secara manual